<title>USA: Titan sells TEMPEST assets to Cycomm.</title>
<headline>Titan sells TEMPEST assets to Cycomm.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Titan Corp and Cycomm International Inc have completed an asset purchase agreement under which Cycomm purchased substantially all of the assets of Titan's TEMPEST computing products division, Delta Data.</p>
<p>Terms of the agreement were not disclosed,</p>
